  "problem": "The data below is taken from the table of values of the cumulative distribution function $Φ(z)$ for the standard normal distribution. Given that $X∼N(-2,{3}^{2}),$ compute $P(-5.9<X<-2.84).$ Use the tables below and do not round your answer.\n\n<table align=\"center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"5\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr> <th width=\"25%\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$z$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.00\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.01\\,$</th><th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.02\\,$</th>\n</tr><tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-1.3\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.0968\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.0951\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.0934\\,$ </td></tr>\n<tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-1.2\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1151\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1131\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1112\\,$ </td></tr>\n<tr> <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-1.1\\,$</th><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1357\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1335\\,$ </td><td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.1314\\,$ </td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</th>\n\n<th width=\"5%\"></th>\n\n<th>\n<table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"5\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr> \n    <th width=\"25%\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$z$</th>\n    <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.07\\,$</th>\n    <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.08\\,$</th>\n    <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,0.09\\,$</th>\n</tr>\n<tr> \n    <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-0.3\\,$</th>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3557\\,$ </td>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3520\\,$ </td>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3483\\,$ </td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n    <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" align=\"center\">$\\,-0.2\\,$</th>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3936\\,$ </td>\n    <td align=\"center\"> $\\,0.3897\\,$ </td>\n    <